    longDescription: `The Cups is a modern Korean dessert café franchise redefining the premium shaved-ice and café experience in Canada. Founded with a vision to introduce authentic Korean bingsu and thoughtfully crafted beverages to the North American market, The Cups blends cultural authenticity with scalable systems, strong brand identity, and a proven franchise model. At the core of The Cups’ concept is bingsu, a finely shaved ice dessert known for its snow-like texture and layered presentation. Unlike traditional ice desserts, The Cups’ bingsu is designed to deliver a light, creamy mouthfeel that pairs perfectly with premium toppings such as fresh fruit, house-made creams, cakes, and seasonal flavors. Signature offerings, alongside rotating limited-time menus, keep customers engaged year-round and encourage repeat visits. Beyond desserts, The Cups operates as a well-rounded café destination, offering specialty drinks, milk-based beverages, and non-espresso options tailored to a wide customer base. The menu is intentionally designed to be approachable while maintaining a premium feel, allowing locations to perform strongly across diverse neighborhoods, from downtown urban cores to suburban family oriented areas. What sets The Cups apart is its franchise-first operating philosophy. The brand has been built with scalability and consistency in mind, providing franchise partners with clear systems, standardized recipes, and operational playbooks that reduce complexity without sacrificing quality.`,
