    description: `The Ugly Driveway: Because Every Homeowner Deserves a Nicer Looking Driveway The driveway is one of the most visible—and most neglected—parts of a home. Whether it's cracked, stained, uneven, or just `,
    longDescription: `The Ugly Driveway: Because Every Homeowner Deserves a Nicer Looking Driveway The driveway is one of the most visible—and most neglected—parts of a home. Whether it's cracked, stained, uneven, or just looking tired, a rough driveway quietly drags down curb appeal. That’s where The Ugly Driveway comes in… They fix driveways. From decorative sealing and paver releveling to crack repair, power washing, lighting, landscaping, concrete staining and more—The Ugly Driveway brings tired surfaces back to life. They don’t just restore beauty, they solve real problems too—leveling sunken areas, removing weeds, repairing cracks, fixing trip hazards and boosting property value. Backed by a blue-collar, hard-working team with a passion for customer service, the brand is built on the simple belief that every homeowner deserves a nicer looking driveway. Before starting any job, the team walks the property with the homeowner to assess not just the driveway but all exterior surfaces—offering a free estimate with honest, practical advice. While driveways are the focus, The Ugly Driveway also revives walkways, porches, patios, and pool decks. The name may be blunt, but the results speak for themselves and with growing demand across Ontario, The Ugly Driveway is now seeking like-minded owner-operators to help expand their mission. Please complete the fields below to contact us (* indicates a required field).`,
