    longDescription: `Leela Eco Spa, a leading Canadian wellbeing brand with eleven locations, and more on the horizon. Leela is opening its doors to like-minded partners through a carefully considered franchise model. Franchisees don’t need spa or business experience; what matters is alignment with Leela’s values of kindness, integrity, and operational excellence. Leela’s culture is what truly sets it apart. Therapists and staff are passionate about their craft, thriving in an environment where positivity and support are the norm. Franchise investment starts at $500,000, with hands-on training taking place over one to two weeks at Leela’s flagship locations in Calgary. Each spa is typically between 2,200-2,500 square feet and offers a range of services like massage therapy, esthetics, manicures and pedicures, etc., all delivered through a personalized, holistic lens. Leela’s success is reflected not just in revenue, but in loyalty. With over 92,000 client visits last year and a 4.7-4.8 average Google rating across thousands of reviews, the brand has grown organically, fueled by word of mouth rather than aggressive marketing. In fact, Leela welcomes between 2,000 to 3,000 new clients each month without relying on memberships or sales tactics. Please complete the fields below to contact us (* indicates a required field). I wish to receive emails and newsletters about franchising from CFA.`,
